      en: "A memorial site in the center of León surrounded by a large mural, dedicated to the fallen of the Sandinista revolution. Mausoleum of Heroes and Martyrs is known for: located on the edge of the parque central in león, a place of constant remembrance of the civil war of the 1970s, an eternal flame burns here in honor of the victims. This region plays an important role in Nicaragua's geography and culture and represents a significant part of the national heritage."
