      en: "A striking monument in the central square of Estelí dedicated to the fighters and civilians who lost their lives during the revolution. Monument to the Fallen of Estelí is known for: estelí experienced some of the heaviest fighting in the late 1970s, the monument is often used for political memorial events, complemented by numerous murals throughout the city. This region plays an important role in Nicaragua's geography and culture and represents a significant part of the national heritage."
